WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.910
- [Kelly Clarkson] What has
been the best thing about

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:03.120
coaching so far?

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.410
- [Ariana Grande] Other than
just getting to know you all

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:07.940
and spend that time and laugh so hard,

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:10.830
I just love seeing the talent
that's on the show and getting

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.620
to know these artists and work with them.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.680
It's just like a really special
experience to be able to

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:18.820
share some of what we've learned
and been able to do in our

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:21.490
lives with these artists that
are just wanting to do the

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:22.323
same thing.

00:00:22.323 --> 00:00:25.310
It's a really special opportunity
to be able to share that

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:27.200
with people to be in that
position is really interesting.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.460
It's just so cool to be there. And yeah,

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.220
they're all so nice and cool. I love them.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.107
I'm obsessed with my team. I
talked to them all the time.

00:00:33.107 --> 00:00:35.488
- You got your first team too.
It's like, you get so upset.

00:00:35.488 --> 00:00:38.520
You love them all. But like, it's like.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:39.440
- I've broken every rule

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.608
in my contract.
- [Kelly] (laughing)

00:00:40.608 --> 00:00:43.040
Talk to them all, all the
time. I'm like, DM-ing them.

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:44.550
They're like, you're
not supposed to do that.

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:46.103
And I'm like, sorry.

00:00:47.952 --> 00:00:48.785
- No, no.

00:00:48.785 --> 00:00:50.480
You're sending stuff to the
hotel for that. You're very,

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:51.910
this is the coolest
thing about you though.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:54.170
I really hope people get to see from you.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:57.380
Like just working with you
on the show like backstage,

00:00:57.380 --> 00:00:59.590
like, I have to have my eye makeup redone,

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:02.950
like she's hysterical. She's so funny.

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:04.840
Very quick witted. I
didn't know this about you.

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:06.720
I knew you were talented, I
knew you'd be a great coach.

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:07.740
I know all those things,

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:10.040
but I didn't know how funny
you were because we'd never

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.733
really hung much.
- I just, lifeless. I know.

00:01:11.733 --> 00:01:14.180
- [Kelly] This is lifeless.
- Seems totally, no, I get it.

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:16.800
- When we're watching you, we
only see, like, performing.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.760
- For sure, and like, Seven
Rings, which is like, what?

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:19.810
Who is that? You know?

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:21.170
- Well, that's a great song.

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:22.280
So, yeah.
- [Ariana] Thank you. But like

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:23.113
what does that even?

00:01:23.113 --> 00:01:23.946
That's like, one of my favorites.

00:01:23.946 --> 00:01:25.230
- You know what I mean,
that's not a person.

00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:26.573
- It's a (laughing) it's not a
- [Ariana] Punchline.

00:01:26.573 --> 00:01:27.877
- She's a robot.
- You know what I mean?

00:01:27.877 --> 00:01:28.710
That's a punchline.

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:29.730
- No, no, but you're hilarious.

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:31.508
And I thought it was so interesting
because usually it takes

00:01:31.508 --> 00:01:32.890
coaches that come on,

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:34.310
like just being there for eight seasons,

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:35.484
it takes them a minute to like,

00:01:35.484 --> 00:01:38.900
get used to like, being free
with like their words and like

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:41.410
their personality. And
you kind of like, right.

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:43.459
It was like, I think the second
or third day of the blinds,

00:01:43.459 --> 00:01:46.030
you were like, nevermind, I'm here.

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:47.140
And it was like, awesome.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.505
Do you, did you find it nerve wracking?

00:01:48.505 --> 00:01:50.060
- It was a little nerve wracking,

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:53.590
but you all made me feel so
comfortable and are the nicest

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:56.280
people that I've met in this whole thing.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.570
Like just the most fun ever.

00:01:57.570 --> 00:01:58.780
And you made me feel so comfortable.

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:00.180
So it's because of you guys,

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:02.650
you guys were pushing and
also Blake was pushing all the

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:03.483
buttons. Sorry.

00:02:03.483 --> 00:02:04.564
I'll shut up.
- Yes, he, no, he wasn't,

00:02:04.564 --> 00:02:05.860
but that's but you know
what he does though?

00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:09.000
Because he feels able to.
That's when I feel like

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:09.970
it's the best chemistry. Yeah.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:11.854
It's helpful. It sets you up for jokes.

00:02:11.854 --> 00:02:14.980
- It does. He gives you
a good, a good setup

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:15.840
every time.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:17.279
- He just opens his mouth. Yeah.

00:02:17.279 --> 00:02:18.112
- That's it.

00:02:18.112 --> 00:02:20.000
He just walks in.
- Well, they act tough.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.710
He just walks in and it's,
there's a joke coming,

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:24.040
but Blake and John are,

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.870
they are terrified of you; look at this.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:27.248
- [Ariana] Oh.
- Yes.

00:02:27.248 --> 00:02:30.980
- [John Legend] Ariana has a huge fan base

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:32.371
and they are fervent.

00:02:32.371 --> 00:02:36.036
And if they show up to
vote, we're all in trouble.

00:02:36.036 --> 00:02:39.603
- 100%. Are you scared at all?

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:41.320
- [Blake Shelton] No.

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:43.330
I'm not afraid of her fan
base. Where are they at?

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:45.023
Look, where's the cameras.

00:02:45.867 --> 00:02:50.100
Bring it on. I'm not afraid of Ariana.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.993
- He is so afraid about Ariana's fan base.

00:02:54.969 --> 00:02:57.560
Thoughts? You, we said this
when you came in, I mean,

00:02:57.560 --> 00:02:58.781
it was apparent, literally
the entire audience

00:02:58.781 --> 00:02:59.614
was screaming.

00:02:59.614 --> 00:03:02.350
We're like, we have no
chance like. It was like,

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:04.129
It was amazing.
- [Ariana] I don't know that

00:03:04.129 --> 00:03:04.962
that's true.
- [Kelly] Well, I'm just

00:03:04.962 --> 00:03:06.040
saying, like, you have a...
- I really do not think that's

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.650
true. I mean,
- But you're, like a,

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:10.370
You're a huge star. I don't know.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.360
News flash. No.
- What are you talking about?

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.570
Kelly Clarkson?
- No, what?

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:15.947
No, I'm just saying, like,
it's one of those things

00:03:15.947 --> 00:03:16.780
(audience claps)

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.880
like you watch out, and...
- Is she okay?

00:03:20.116 --> 00:03:22.243
- Sorry.
- No! It's so different.

00:03:22.243 --> 00:03:25.310
Anyway, we're all, it's
got to feel a little good,

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:27.620
like, little bit of
competitiveness in you.

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:29.290
It's gotta be like, they're
all a little terrified.

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:31.770
- I really don't think
that I have the chance

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.287
you think I have.
- You can think all you want,

00:03:33.287 --> 00:03:34.370
but it's true.

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:35.719
- First of all,

00:03:35.719 --> 00:03:38.920
the beautiful thing about
it is that even just

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:39.930
being on the show,

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:42.210
this is such a beautiful chance
for them to be seen by the

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:43.230
world in a new way.
- Yeah.

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:46.180
- This is just us getting to
meet them and give them this

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.950
first chance.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.040
And it's really special
- Big opportunity.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:49.873
because I think you're going to fall

00:03:49.873 --> 00:03:51.349
in love with all of them. I really do.

00:03:51.349 --> 00:03:53.272
- They're so good.
- Yeah. - They're so good.

